      "text": "async function fun(){\n  const response = await p1;\n  return response;\n}\n\n// await fun()    //we can't use await outside async function (it will have no effect)\n// fun().then((data)=>console.log(data)).catch((err)=>console.log(err));\n\nasync function fun2(){\n  const data = await fun();\n  console.log(data);\n}\n\nfun2();",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "async function fun(){\n  const response = await p1;\n  return response;\n}\n\n// await fun()    //we can't use await outside async function (it will have no effect)\n// fun().then((data)=>console.log(data)).catch((err)=>console.log(err));\n\nasync function fun2(){\n  const data = await fun();\n  console.log(data);\n}\n\nfun2();",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
